From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS Engineering <engineering@sableos.org>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 16:10:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] telephony: add Titan 2 legacy writeRilAnswer overload

N1I-C1 V6F proved an exact ABI gap between the Titan 2 stock IMS binary and
the Android 16 TrebleDroid TelephonyMetrics compatibility stub:

  stock TelephonyMetrics.writeRilAnswer: (II)V
  C3A/C1 TelephonyMetrics.writeRilAnswer: (IIII)V
  ImsRILAdapter call site:               (II)V

The Android 16 TelephonyMetrics class in this source graph is already a no-op
compatibility stub for MediaTek IMS. Add only the legacy two-argument overload
required by the observed Titan 2 caller. Keep the existing four-argument
overload unchanged.

This imports no stock framework implementation and changes no metrics
semantics: both overloads are no-op compatibility surfaces.
---
 .../internal/telephony/metrics/TelephonyMetrics.java | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/metrics/TelephonyMetrics.java b/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/metrics/TelephonyMetrics.java
index 27638e5be9c0..9d5108e0ddb8 100644
--- a/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/metrics/TelephonyMetrics.java
+++ b/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/metrics/TelephonyMetrics.java
@@ -60,6 +60,14 @@ public class TelephonyMetrics {
     }
 
     /**
+     * No-op legacy overload. Titan 2 stock IMS invokes the pre-Android-16
+     * TelephonyMetrics ABI with phoneId and rilSerial only.
+     */
+    public void writeRilAnswer(int phoneId, int rilSerial) {
+        // No-op stub for MediaTek IMS compatibility
+    }
+
+    /**
      * No-op stub. Called by ImsRILAdapter when answering a call.
      */
     public void writeRilAnswer(int phoneId, int rilSerial, int rilError, int rilRequest) {
-- 
